{"seq":1,"slug":"tests-as-agent-guardrails","title":"测试作为 Agent 的护栏","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/tests-as-agent-guardrails","wordCount":1998,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试作为-agent-的护栏\">测试作为 Agent 的护栏</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>agent 最强大也最危险的特质，是它<strong>敢改、能改、改得快</strong>。把这股力量变成可靠生产力的关键，是给它一个能<strong>自动判断「对不对」的回路</strong>——而测试正是这个回路的核心。本篇不复述常识，而是给三个论点补上 2025–2026 年的可核验证据：红绿信号为何必须取代主观判断、什么样的测试属性对 agent 是硬约束、以及测试如何改写人机分工的界面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>把「测试作为护栏」拆成几个可迁移的断言：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>红绿信号取代主观判断</strong>：正确性判断从人的脑子搬到机器上；连资深开发者对自身效率的主观评估都能与实测背离，就更不能指望 agent「自觉」正确。</li>\n<li><strong>反馈延迟决定吞吐上限</strong>：预算内可完成的纠错轮数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mi>T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>edit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx \\lfloor T/(t_{\\text{edit}}+t_{\\text{verify}}) \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)⌋</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{verify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 越短，agent 在同样预算下试错越多。</li>\n<li><strong>对 agent 的硬约束</strong>：快且确定、结果稳定、测行为非实现、失败信息自解释——因为 agent 跑测试的频次远高于人，任何慢与不稳都会被循环放大。</li>\n<li><strong>验证入口单一可达</strong>：给仓库一个幂等的一键验证命令，并写进 AGENTS.md 类入口约定。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"测试是-agent-的自我纠错回路\">测试是 agent 的自我纠错回路</h2><p>红绿信号的真正价值，在于<strong>把正确性判断从人的脑子里搬到机器上</strong>。Claude Code 官方最佳实践把这件事写成一句操作指南：「给 Claude 一个它能运行的检查：测试、构建、或一张用来对比的截图」（<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/best-practices\">Claude Code Best Practices</a>）。Anthropic 在长时程编码 agent 实验中给出了更细的量化观察：为 agent 配好测试工具后，它能发现并修掉仅凭阅读代码看不出来的 bug，表现显著改善；实验中的编码 agent 每次会话的第一步就是启动开发服务器、跑一遍基础端到端测试——先确认应用不在损坏状态，再动新功能（<a href=\"https://www.anthropic.com/engineering/effective-harnesses-for-long-running-agents\">Effective harnesses for long-running agents</a>，2025-11）。</p>\n<p>主观感觉替代不了这个回路，这一点已被严格实验证实。METR 的随机对照试验（arXiv:2507.09089）招募 16 名资深开源开发者，在自己平均贡献了五年的成熟项目上完成 246 个真实任务：开工前他们预测 AI 工具能省 24% 时间，完工后自估省了 20%，实测却<strong>慢了 19%</strong>。连资深开发者对自身效率的主观评估都能与实测严重背离，就更不能指望 agent「自觉」正确——唯一可信的是每次改动后客观运行的红绿。</p>\n<p>反馈延迟则决定回路的吞吐上限。设单轮时间预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，单次改动耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>edit</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{edit}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、验证耗时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{verify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则预算内能完成的纠错轮数约为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>≈</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">⌊</mo><mfrac><mi>T</mi><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>edit</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N \\approx \\left\\lfloor \\frac{T}{t_{\\text{edit}} + t_{\\text{verify}}} \\right\\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4221em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌊</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>verify</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{verify}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9012em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">verify</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 从五分钟压到十秒，同样的预算下 agent 从「试两三轮」变为「试几十轮」——秒级单测与增量检查因此不是锦上添花，而是护栏能否成立的前提。比测试更早的一道关——类型与契约——见<a href=\"types-contracts-fast-feedback\">类型契约与快速反馈</a>。整个回路可以画成一个双速门禁环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[agent 提交改动] --&gt; B{快速门禁&lt;br/&gt;类型检查 加单测}&#10;    B -- 绿 --&gt; C{慢速门禁&lt;br/&gt;集成 加 E2E}&#10;    B -- 红 --&gt; D[读失败输出&lt;br/&gt;定位并修正]&#10;    D --&gt; A&#10;    C -- 绿 --&gt; E[人工审查&lt;br/&gt;意图与设计]&#10;    C -- 红 --&gt; D\">flowchart LR\n    A[agent 提交改动] --&gt; B{快速门禁&lt;br/&gt;类型检查 加单测}\n    B -- 绿 --&gt; C{慢速门禁&lt;br/&gt;集成 加 E2E}\n    B -- 红 --&gt; D[读失败输出&lt;br/&gt;定位并修正]\n    D --&gt; A\n    C -- 绿 --&gt; E[人工审查&lt;br/&gt;意图与设计]\n    C -- 红 --&gt; D</pre><h2 id=\"什么样的测试对-agent-最有用\">什么样的测试对 agent 最有用</h2><p>对人有效的测试原则，在 agent 场景会被放大成硬约束——因为 agent 跑测试的频次远高于人，任何一点慢与不稳都会被循环持续放大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>属性</th>\n<th>为什么对 agent 是硬约束</th>\n<th>典型反模式</th>\n<th>可核验依据</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>快且确定</td>\n<td>agent 反复全量重跑，慢测试直接压缩迭代数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>分钟级集成套件混进内层循环</td>\n<td>见下文 Google flaky 治理数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结果稳定</td>\n<td>随机红会让 agent 为不存在的回归乱改</td>\n<td>网络抖动、并发竞态留在主门禁</td>\n<td>Google：84% 由绿转红是 flaky 所致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测行为非实现</td>\n<td>重构内部时护栏仍然守得住</td>\n<td>断言私有调用序列，绑死实现</td>\n<td>SWE-bench 用真实 issue 行为定义任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败信息自解释</td>\n<td>报错本身就是定位线索</td>\n<td>只输出 <code>assert failed</code> 逼 agent 盲猜</td>\n<td>harness 实验规定自验通过才许标完成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Google 对 flaky 测试的治理提供了两个可直接搬用的机制：允许只重跑失败的用例；以及把测试标记为 flaky 之后，<strong>连续失败 3 次</strong>才计为真失败。背景数字同样值得记住：其全部测试语料中持续约有 <strong>1.5%</strong> 的测试运行报出 flaky 结果——本质是给随机信号加去噪滤波器，否则 agent（和人）会不断为噪声付费，甚至养成「见红就重跑」的习惯，把真回归也一并忽略（<a href=\"https://testing.googleblog.com/2016/05/flaky-tests-at-google-and-how-we.html\">Flaky Tests at Google and How We Mitigate Them</a>）。「行为而非实现」的极致范本是 SWE-bench：2,294 道题目全部取自真实 GitHub issue 及其对应 PR，横跨 12 个流行 Python 仓库，判分不看代码像不像，只看测试是否转绿（arXiv:2310.06770）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试如何重塑人机协作\">测试如何重塑人机协作</h2><p>第一个变化是<strong>意图的交付形态</strong>：人从「描述要什么」升级为「定义什么算对」。上述 harness 实验里，初始化 agent 会先把需求拆成结构化的 <code>feature_list.json</code>（逐条端到端功能清单），配好 <code>init.sh</code> 启动脚本与进度笔记，编码 agent 才接手；并且明文规定「只有经过仔细测试，才允许把功能标记为已通过」。这份清单实际上是人机之间精确到可执行的验收契约——测试先行的当代形态，不再是方法论口号，而是 agent 工程的装配步骤。</p>\n<p>第二个变化是<strong>信任有了客观标尺</strong>。METR 数据显示主观评估与实测之间可以差出四十多个百分点（预测 −24% 对实际 +19%），所以「哪些模块可以放手」就不应锚定在对某个模型或某段提示词的印象上，而应锚定在该模块的测试密度与缺陷逃逸历史上。由此推出一条实用的准入序列：测试稀薄的模块，先让 agent 补 characterization test（刻画现状行为的测试），人审查这些测试是否抓住了真实语义，然后才开放自主修改。顺序颠倒——先放手再补测试——等于让 agent 在无护栏区域试错，是最常见的翻车路径。「哪类改动可以给到多少自主权」的完整分级，见<a href=\"small-reversible-changes\">小步可逆的变更</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实践要点\">实践要点</h2><p>落地的关键不是「多写测试」，而是把验证做成 agent 一步可达的单一入口：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>给仓库一个幂等的一键验证命令（例如 <code>make check</code> 或 <code>init.sh</code>），并把它的用法写进 <code>AGENTS.md</code> 这类 agent 入口约定——agent 读到的第一条指令应当就是「如何自证没搞坏东西」。</li>\n<li>把 flaky 隔离出主门禁：配置失败重跑、维护隔离名单、启用连败计数——Google 的数据表明多数由绿转红是假警报，别让它们淹没真回归的信号价值。</li>\n<li>失败输出按「可直接粘贴给另一个 agent」的标准设计：包含最小复现输入、期望值与实际值的 diff、涉及文件的精确行号。</li>\n<li>新模块进入自主区之前，固定走三步：agent 补现状测试 → 人审测试语义 → 再放开修改权限。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>测试护栏的本质是把正确性从脑内判断外置为可重复执行的信号。工程侧证据（Anthropic harness 实验、Claude Code 官方指南）表明它直接提升 agent 表现；实证侧证据（METR 对照试验）表明缺了它连资深工程师的主观评估都不可靠。质量参数归结为三个：快、确定、失败信息自解释——其余皆为其推论。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试作为 Agent 的护栏","id":"测试作为-agent-的护栏"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"测试是 agent 的自我纠错回路","id":"测试是-agent-的自我纠错回路"},{"level":2,"text":"什么样的测试对 agent 最有用","id":"什么样的测试对-agent-最有用"},{"level":2,"text":"测试如何重塑人机协作","id":"测试如何重塑人机协作"},{"level":2,"text":"实践要点","id":"实践要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"显式胜于隐式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/legibility-and-navigation/explicit-over-implicit"},"next":{"title":"类型契约与快速反馈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-architecture/verifiability-and-safe-change/types-contracts-fast-feedback"}}